---
import PolicySection from "./PolicySection.astro";
import { ul } from "./styles";
---

<PolicySection title="Do you have to give us your data">
  <ul class:list={ul}>
    <li>
      An e-mail address is needed to create an account, and a nickname (2 to 24 characters) before you can use the
      dashboard; without them the service cannot work.
    </li>
    <li>
      There are no automated decisions with legal or similarly significant effects; the leaderboard only adds up
      streaks.
    </li>
  </ul>
</PolicySection>
